<title>BELGIUM: KB Securities rates Barco add.</title>
<headline>KB Securities rates Barco add.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>Barco		 Electronics 5,820 *    KB Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Management has raised its expectations for growth in current earnings to &quot;15 percent&quot; from &quot;10 to 15 percent&quot;. The company also has a solid financial position and the cash to make acquisitions. The only drawback to present outlook is prospect of corporate tax rate rising to 34 percent from present 20 percent by 1999.</p>
<p>Recommendation: ADD  Analyst: Johan Pede</p>
<p>(*) Date of research report: 03/04/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Net dividend</p>
<p> 1996A	  229 BFR    n/a	 23.9    46.5 BFR</p>
<p> 1997	   280 BFR    n/a	 20.8    56.3 BFR</p>
<p> 1998	   299 BFR    n/a	 19.5    63.8 BFR</p>
